    "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
    "licenseUrl": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0",
    "description": "Saree Soiree is an homage to the timeless sophistication of Tamil Nadu's fashion, where each ensemble tells a story of cultural legacy intertwined with the freshness of contemporary style. It is an editorial that invites the audience to witness the metamorphosis of tradition into a chic, modern narrative, where every frame is a testimony to the enduring allure of the saree in the heartland of fashion. This concept is a celebration of the timeless allure of the saree, a garment that transcends eras, blending the richness of heritage with a contemporary edge. Colors burst forth in a vibrant dance, and intricate jewelry harmonizes with the opulence of silk, creating a mesmerizing tapestry of elegance.",
    "sourceUrl": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/54/Saree_Soiree_6.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original",
